Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(private-mode):=20Option=20B=20=E2=80=94=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?async=20BUSINESS=20confirmation=20after=20timeout=20(fail-close?=
 =?UTF-8?q?d)?=
